{"metadata": {"metadata_json": "{\"asin\": \"B07XFHWCPF\", \"parent_asin\": \"B07XFHWCPF\", \"rating\": 1.0, \"timestamp\": 1581029427860, \"title\": \"Not worth it\", \"verified_purchase\": true}", "partition": "evaluation", "primary_group": "product:B07XFHWCPF", "secondary_group": "author:AGAXXSMNXMWRZTJOIJLQHSDVRBRA", "simhash64": "5178bf9141d4f7b4", "source_record_id": "AGAXXSMNXMWRZTJOIJLQHSDVRBRA:B07XFHWCPF:1581029427860", "text_sha256": "f995b24860b85c8c5a7bdaf08b667957f03b728717d658fa5d84ea1b973f2ae9"}, "review_id": "amazon_all_beauty:f4dd359bbc5f6523808d52d3", "review_text": "First the lids to the nail polish popped off and I couldn't use them. So I tried with what was left and it still didn't work. I couldn't hang onto to the numb to try and do my nails. So I did the best I could with what I had and it turned out awful. I would not recommend this product. Waste of money!!!!"}
